      "verified_by": "A-ROOT-INT32-PAYLOAD-WIDTH-WITHIN-REMAINING-BYTES",
      "fine_trace_step": 11,
      "description": "Root cause. The per-type bounds check treats `bcf_type_shift[t]` as a byte count even though it stores a shift exponent. For `BCF_BT_INT32`, the table entry is `2`, so a two-byte remainder is accepted even though the next statement will read 4 bytes."
    },
